    cssRule: "opacity: 1\ntransform: scale(1)"
    responsive: false
    description: "* Native <dialog> shell — same .modal / regions / sizes.\n * Prefer showModal() + closedby / invoker commands over .modal-overlay when Baseline allows.\n * <!-- GAP: popover surface utilities — use .card inside [popover] for now -->"
